<p>The average adult running flat out reaches approximately 8 to 10 mph. Mbappé at his career best runs 23.6 mph — <strong>more than twice the speed of most adults at maximum effort.</strong> Even a fit recreational runner at 14 mph is still 9 mph slower than the top World Cup sprinters.</p>
